## Where to Look

| If you're working on... | Read first |
|------------------------|------------|
| New feature | `docs/product-specs/index.md` → relevant spec |
| Bug fix | `docs/RELIABILITY.md` → domain doc |
| UI/Frontend | `docs/FRONTEND.md` → `docs/DESIGN.md` |
| Database | `docs/generated/db-schema.md` → domain doc |
| API changes | `docs/generated/api-routes.md` → `docs/SECURITY.md` |
| Architecture change | `ARCHITECTURE.md` → `docs/design-docs/core-beliefs.md` |
| New plan | `docs/PLANS.md` → `docs/exec-plans/_template.md` |

## Working with Plans

- **Small changes** (1-3 files): describe in PR, no plan file needed
- **Complex work** (4+ files or multi-session): create `docs/exec-plans/active/<name>.md`
- **Template**: `docs/exec-plans/_template.md`
- **When done**: move plan to `docs/exec-plans/completed/`

